OL,2,Q*%*-*%/*%/*%,'  C   STERN TEST       Qj
OL,3,Q5GDAVIS CUP     C   FOR BATES        Qj
OL,4,Q#######################################
OL,5,FJeremy Bates, 23, carries the
OL,6,Fresponsibility of openingCGreat
OL,7,CBritain'sFcrucial first round tie with
OL,8,CSpainFat Telford.
OL,10,FThe British number two, who made his
OL,11,FCup debut only last year, faces Spain's
OL,12,Ftop player Sergio Casal, who is ranked
OL,13,F39th in the world.
OL,15,FBut team captain Paul Hutchins thinks
OL,16,Fthe fast-improving Bates is ready for
OL,17,Fthe test. "He is happy at starting the
OL,18,Ftie as it saves him hanging around."
OL,20,FJohn Lloyd will once again be Britain's
OL,21,Ftrump card and must beat Emilio Sanchez
OL,22,Ftomorrow to give Britain any hope.
OL,23,Q]GFrom 06-03-86 / teletextarchive.com
