OL,2,Q/.!+.!/*%/*%/"-' C  MARSH IN EURO    Qj
OL,3,Q5GISLE OF MAN      CTITLE DEFENCE    Qj
OL,4,Q#######################################
OL,5,FBasildon firemanCTerry MarshFwill
OL,6,Fdefend his European light-welterweight
OL,7,Ftitle against DaneCMohamed KowoyaFat
OL,8,FPalace Lido, Isle of Man, on April 12.
OL,10,FMeanwhile, Marsh has been offered a
OL,11,Ffight with WBC champion Lonnie Smith.
OL,13,FBut he would rather wait to meet the
OL,14,Fwinner of next week's WBA title fight
OL,15,Fbetween Patricio Oliva, of Italy, and
OL,16,FUbaldo Sacco in Monte Carlo.
OL,18,FThe delayed British heavyweight title
OL,19,Fcontest between holderCHughroy Currie
OL,20,FandCHorace NoticeFwill be a supporting
OL,21,Fbout on the Marsh-Kowoya bill.
OL,22,                    C  Bruno poser >>>>>
OL,23,Q]GFrom 06-03-86 / teletextarchive.com
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
