OL,1,Q{$~k4oz%h7}h7q##################G6/10
OL,2,Q/.!+.!/*%/*%/"-'   C  EBU POSER      Qj
OL,3,Q5GEUROPEAN TITLE     CFOR BRUNO      Qj
OL,4,Q#######################################
OL,5,FFrank Bruno must soon decide whether to
OL,6,Fkeep his European heavyweight crown.
OL,8,FBruno, who bludgeoned the EBU title
OL,9,Ffrom Swede Anders Eklund last year, has
OL,10,Fbeen ordered to defend it against
OL,11,FDutchman Andre Van Den Oetelaar.
OL,13,FPurse offers are due shortly, but the
OL,14,FLondoner, now aiming for the world
OL,15,Ftitle, is likely to find that fight
OL,16,Fdifficult to fit into his plans.
OL,18,FManager Terry Lawless said it was
OL,19,Fsomething he and Bruno must discuss.
OL,21,FBut Lawless added: "He does not want to
OL,22,Fgive anything up "C   Marsh defence >>>
OL,23,Q]GFrom 06-03-86 / teletextarchive.com
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
