OL,2,Q+.!/*%/"-'*%/*- /C   ROBINSON OUT -  Qj
OL,3,Q5GSECOND TEST     C  SMITH DOUBTFUL  Qj
OL,4,Q#######################################
OL,5,FEngland go into Friday's Test in Port
OL,6,Fof Spain, Trinidad, without Tim
OL,7,FRobinson and also have a major fitness
OL,8,Fdoubt over left-hander David Smith.
OL,10,FRobinson is out because he is still
OL,11,Fsuffering the after effects of heat
OL,12,Fstroke and dehydration, which will
OL,13,Fallow Wilf Slack to make his Test debut
OL,15,FSmith, who made his bow in the First
OL,16,FTest, has a back problem which has
OL,17,Fdeveloped since he crashed into an
OL,18,Fadvertising hoarding in the one-day win
OL,20,FThe 30-year-old was unable to practice
OL,21,Ftoday and said: "It's not looking good"
OL,22,           CMoves on bouncer problem >>>
OL,23,Q]GFrom 06-03-86 / teletextarchive.com
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
